cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Pramāṇa: an open database of Indian literature and primary sources"
message: "If you use Pramāṇa, please cite it as below, and cite passages by their path (https://indike.org/pramana/<path>)."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Mahalingam"
    given-names: "Sri"
    affiliation: "Independent researcher"
url: "https://indike.org/pramana/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/srajma/pramana-data"
abstract: >-
  An open database of the primary sources of the Indian subcontinent: a catalogue of 205,407 works, 51,241 with
  their text (18.5 million passages, 575 million words in 93 languages), with recensions, commentaries and
  translations aligned passage by passage, plus inscriptions, archaeological sites, coins and museum objects.
keywords: [Sanskrit, Pali, Prakrit, Tamil, Indology, digital library, parallel corpus, epigraphy, digital humanities]
license: CC-BY-4.0
